@startuml 使用案例3_3: 申請審核通知
title 使用案例3.3: 申請審核通知

actor "申請者\n( 一般會員或收容所會員 )" as Applicant
participant "NotificationCenter.vue" as NotificationPage
participant "NotificationBell.vue" as NotificationBell
participant "useNotifications.ts" as NotificationComposable
participant "notifications.py(blueprint)" as NotificationBlueprint
participant "notification_service.py" as NotificationService
participant "email_tasks.py" as EmailTasks
participant "email_service.py" as EmailService
participant "others.py(Notification)(model)" as NotificationModel
participant "user.py(model)" as UserModel
participant "application.py(model)" as ApplicationModel
participant "animal.py(model)" as AnimalModel
participant "Celery Worker" as CeleryWorker
database "MySQL" as DB

== 1. 前置條件 ==
note over Applicant, DB
  前置條件:
  - 申請者已提交領養申請 (Use Case 1.4)
  - 送養者已完成審核 (Use Case 3.2)
  - 審核結果為 APPROVED 或 REJECTED
end note

== 2. 審核完成後觸發通知 (由 3.2 觸發) ==
note over NotificationService, DB
  此階段由 Use Case 3.2 (申請審核作業) 觸發
  review_application() 完成後自動執行
end note
== 2. 審核完成後觸發通知 (由 3.2 觸發) ==
note over NotificationService, DB
  此階段由 Use Case 3.2 (申請審核作業) 觸發
  review_application() 完成後自動執行
end note

NotificationService -> NotificationService: notify_application_reviewed(application, reviewer_id, status, review_notes)
activate NotificationService

NotificationService -> AnimalModel: Animal.query.get(application.animal_id)
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM animals WHERE animal_id=?
activate DB
DB --> AnimalModel: animal 資料
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> NotificationService: Animal 物件 (取得 animal_name)
deactivate AnimalModel

== 3. 建立系統內通知 ==
NotificationService -> NotificationService: 決定通知類型
note right
  根據審核結果選擇:
  - status == 'APPROVED'
    → type = 'application_approved'
  - status == 'REJECTED'
    → type = 'application_rejected'
  
  payload 包含:
  - application_id
  - animal_id
  - animal_name
  - status
  - review_notes
end note

NotificationService -> NotificationModel: 建立通知記錄
activate NotificationModel
NotificationModel -> DB: INSERT INTO notifications\\n(recipient_id, actor_id, type,\\npayload, read, created_at)\\nVALUES (applicant_id, reviewer_id, ?, ?, FALSE, NOW())
activate DB
note right
  通知內容:
  - recipient_id: 申請者 ID
  - actor_id: 審核者 ID
  - type: application_approved/rejected
  - payload: JSON 包含動物和審核資訊
  - read: FALSE (未讀)
end note
DB --> NotificationModel: notification_id
deactivate DB
NotificationModel --> NotificationService: Notification 物件
deactivate NotificationModel

== 4. 發送 Email 通知 (非同步) ==
NotificationService -> UserModel: User.query.get(application.applicant_id)
activate UserModel
UserModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE user_id=?
activate DB
DB --> UserModel: applicant 資料
deactivate DB
UserModel --> NotificationService: Applicant 物件 (取得 email)
deactivate UserModel

NotificationService -> UserModel: User.query.get(animal.owner_id)
activate UserModel
UserModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE user_id=?
activate DB
DB --> UserModel: owner 資料
deactivate DB
UserModel --> NotificationService: Owner 物件 (取得聯絡資訊)
deactivate UserModel

NotificationService -> EmailTasks: send_application_notification_email_task.delay(\\n  user_email=applicant.email,\\n  animal_name=animal.name,\\n  status='approved' or 'rejected',\\n  message=review_notes,\\n  contact_info={name, email, phone})
activate EmailTasks
note right
  透過 Celery 非同步處理:
  - user_email: 申請者 Email
  - animal_name: 動物名稱
  - status: 'approved' 或 'rejected'
  - message: 審核意見 (review_notes)
  - contact_info: 送養者聯絡資訊
    (只在 approved 時包含)
end note

EmailTasks -> CeleryWorker: 加入任務佇列
activate CeleryWorker
EmailTasks --> NotificationService: 任務已排程
deactivate EmailTasks
deactivate NotificationService

== 5. Celery Worker 處理 Email ==
CeleryWorker -> EmailService: send_email(\\n  to=user_email,\\n  subject='申請已通過/拒絕',\\n  template='application_notification',\\n  context={...})
activate EmailService

EmailService -> EmailService: 渲染 Email 模板
note right
  根據 status 選擇內容:
  
  **approved (核准)**:
  - 主旨: "您的領養申請已通過 - {animal_name}"
  - 內容: 恭喜訊息
  - 包含: 審核意見、送養者聯絡方式
  - 引導: 請盡快聯絡送養者
  
  **rejected (拒絕)**:
  - 主旨: "關於您的領養申請 - {animal_name}"
  - 內容: 婉轉說明
  - 包含: 審核意見 (拒絕原因)
  - 引導: 可繼續瀏覽其他動物
end note

EmailService -> EmailService: 透過 SMTP 發送郵件
note right
  使用配置的 SMTP 服務:
  - Gmail / AWS SES 等
  - 重試機制: 最多 3 次
  - 失敗時記錄錯誤
end note

alt 發送成功
  EmailService --> CeleryWorker: 發送成功
  CeleryWorker -> CeleryWorker: 記錄發送成功日誌
else 發送失敗
  EmailService --> CeleryWorker: 發送失敗
  CeleryWorker -> CeleryWorker: 重試 (最多 3 次)
  note right
    重試延遲: 60 * (2 ^ retries) 秒
    - 第 1 次: 60 秒後
    - 第 2 次: 120 秒後
    - 第 3 次: 240 秒後
  end note
end

deactivate EmailService
deactivate CeleryWorker

== 6. 申請者接收系統通知 ==
Applicant -> NotificationBell: 登入系統後查看通知鈴鐺
activate NotificationBell

NotificationBell -> NotificationComposable: startPolling()
activate NotificationComposable
note right
  通知輪詢機制:
  - 每 30 秒自動檢查
  - 頁面載入時立即執行
  - 離開頁面時停止
end note

NotificationComposable -> NotificationBlueprint: GET /notifications/unread-count
activate NotificationBlueprint
NotificationBlueprint -> DB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM notifications\\nWHERE recipient_id=? AND read=FALSE
activate DB
DB --> NotificationBlueprint: unread_count
deactivate DB
NotificationBlueprint --> NotificationComposable: {unread_count: N}
deactivate NotificationBlueprint

NotificationComposable --> NotificationBell: 更新未讀數量徽章
NotificationBell --> Applicant: 顯示紅色數字徽章 (N)
deactivate NotificationComposable
deactivate NotificationBell

== 7. 申請者查看通知詳情 ==
Applicant -> NotificationBell: 點擊通知鈴鐺
activate NotificationBell
NotificationBell -> NotificationPage: 導航到 /notifications
activate NotificationPage

NotificationPage -> NotificationComposable: fetchNotifications()
activate NotificationComposable
NotificationComposable -> NotificationBlueprint: GET /notifications
activate NotificationBlueprint
NotificationBlueprint -> NotificationModel: Notification.query.filter_by(\\n  recipient_id=current_user_id,\\n  deleted_at=None).order_by(created_at.desc())
activate NotificationModel
NotificationModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM notifications\\nWHERE recipient_id=? AND deleted_at IS NULL\\nORDER BY created_at DESC
activate DB
DB --> NotificationModel: notifications 列表
deactivate DB
NotificationModel --> NotificationBlueprint: Notification 物件列表
deactivate NotificationModel
NotificationBlueprint --> NotificationComposable: {notifications: [...], total: N}
deactivate NotificationBlueprint

NotificationComposable --> NotificationPage: 通知列表資料
deactivate NotificationComposable

NotificationPage -> NotificationPage: 渲染通知卡片
note right
  通知卡片顯示:
  - 圖示: ✅ (approved) 或 ❌ (rejected)
  - 標題: "申請已通過" 或 "申請已拒絕"
  - 內容: "您的申請已通過：{animal_name}"
  - 時間: "X 分鐘前" / "X 小時前"
  - 狀態: 未讀 (藍色邊框) / 已讀
  
  審核意見:
  - 顯示在通知內容中
  - 可展開查看完整訊息
end note

NotificationPage --> Applicant: 顯示通知列表
deactivate NotificationBell

== 8. 申請者點擊通知 ==
Applicant -> NotificationPage: 點擊通知卡片
activate NotificationPage

NotificationPage -> NotificationComposable: markAsRead(notification_id)
activate NotificationComposable
NotificationComposable -> NotificationBlueprint: POST /notifications/{id}/mark-read
activate NotificationBlueprint
NotificationBlueprint -> NotificationModel: notification.read = True\\nnotification.read_at = NOW()
activate NotificationModel
NotificationModel -> DB: UPDATE notifications\\nSET read=TRUE, read_at=NOW()\\nWHERE notification_id=?
activate DB
DB --> NotificationModel: 更新成功
deactivate DB
NotificationModel --> NotificationBlueprint: Notification 物件
deactivate NotificationModel
NotificationBlueprint --> NotificationComposable: 已標記為已讀
deactivate NotificationBlueprint

NotificationComposable --> NotificationPage: 更新本地狀態
deactivate NotificationComposable

alt 申請已通過 (APPROVED)
  NotificationPage -> NotificationPage: 顯示審核意見和送養者聯絡資訊
  note right
    通知內容包含:
    - 動物名稱和資訊
    - 審核者的評論/意見
    - 送養者聯絡方式:
      * 姓名
      * Email
      * 電話 (如有)
    - 提示: "請盡快聯絡送養者安排領養事宜"
  end note
  
  NotificationPage --> Applicant: 顯示完整審核結果和聯絡資訊
  
  Applicant -> Applicant: 根據聯絡資訊連絡送養者
  note right
    申請者可以:
    1. 複製送養者 Email
    2. 撥打電話
    3. 透過平台訊息聯繫 (若有)
    
    後續領養流程:
    - 約定時間見面
    - 確認領養條件
    - 辦理領養手續
    - 完成動物交接
  end note
  
else 申請已拒絕 (REJECTED)
  NotificationPage -> NotificationPage: 顯示拒絕原因
  note right
    通知內容包含:
    - 動物名稱和資訊
    - 拒絕原因 (review_notes)
    - 鼓勵訊息:
      "感謝您的申請，請不要氣餒"
      "歡迎繼續瀏覽其他待領養動物"
    
    不包含送養者聯絡資訊
  end note
  
  NotificationPage --> Applicant: 顯示拒絕原因和鼓勵訊息
  
  Applicant -> Applicant: 可繼續瀏覽其他動物
end

deactivate NotificationPage

== 9. 申請者接收 Email ==
note over Applicant, EmailService
  並行處理: Email 通知與系統通知同時進行
  申請者會在收件匣收到郵件
end note

Applicant -> Applicant: 檢查 Email 收件匣
note right
  Email 內容與系統通知一致:
  - HTML 格式，排版美觀
  - 包含平台 Logo 和品牌元素
  - 核准時包含送養者完整聯絡資訊
  - 包含返回平台連結
  
  Email 優勢:
  - 即時收到通知 (不需登入平台)
  - 可保存為記錄
  - 方便轉發給家人討論
end note

note over Applicant, DB
  **後置條件:**
  1. 系統內通知已建立並存入資料庫
  2. Email 已透過 Celery 非同步發送給申請者
  3. 申請者可在通知中心查看審核結果
  4. 核准時，申請者可取得送養者聯絡資訊
  5. 拒絕時，申請者可查看拒絕原因
  6. 通知支援標記已讀和刪除操作
  
  **通知類型:**
  - application_approved: 申請已通過
  - application_rejected: 申請已拒絕
  
  **通知內容 (payload):**
  - application_id: 申請 ID
  - animal_id: 動物 ID
  - animal_name: 動物名稱
  - status: APPROVED / REJECTED
  - review_notes: 審核意見
  
  **Email 內容:**
  - 主旨: 根據狀態自動生成
  - 模板: application_notification
  - 上下文變數:
    * animal_name: 動物名稱
    * status: 審核狀態
    * message: 審核意見
    * contact_info: 送養者聯絡資訊 (僅核准時)
  
  **輪詢機制:**
  - 間隔: 30 秒
  - 自動: 登入後自動啟動
  - 停止: 離開頁面時停止
  - API: GET /notifications/unread-count
  
  **Celery 非同步處理:**
  - 任務: send_application_notification_email_task
  - 重試: 最多 3 次
  - 延遲: 指數退避 (60s, 120s, 240s)
  - 錯誤: 記錄到日誌但不影響主流程
  
  **前端通知中心功能:**
  - 顯示所有通知 (已讀/未讀)
  - 篩選: 全部 / 未讀 / 已讀
  - 操作: 標記已讀 / 全部已讀 / 刪除
  - 即時: 通過輪詢保持最新狀態
  - 導航: 點擊通知可跳轉相關頁面
end note

@enduml
